JQEEngine.start() now logs via core.logger instead of printing.
Adds full type hints and Google-style docstrings to the class and its
public methods. No behavior change.

Adds tests/test_jqe_engine.py — a real pytest test file for the
engine's construction and delegation behavior. Named to avoid
colliding with the pre-existing tests/test_core_engine.py, which is a
manual debug script, not a real test (see docs/roadmap.md, Milestone
4).
